# Line ending policy — Plan 550 fixup.

# Force LF for Handlebars prompt templates regardless of core.autocrlf.
# Without this, on Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true, every .hbs
# file gets rewritten with CRLF, which then leaks through Handlebars.render
# and breaks byte-level parity tests against the TS source-of-truth. See
# docs/exec-plans/active/550-prompt-hbs-and-agent-decomposition.md for the
# pre-existing failure set this resolves.
*.hbs        text eol=lf
*.md.hbs     text eol=lf